  "dcterms:title": "Chemical Effects in Biological Systems (CEBS)",
  "dcterms:description": "Toxicology study data from the NIEHS/NTP Chemical Effects in Biological Systems (CEBS) resource. The brick scrapes the CEBS datasets index at https://cebs-ext.niehs.nih.gov/datasets/ and retrieves each dataset (clinical chemistry, hematology, organ weight, genotoxicity such as Ames and micronucleus, etc.) via the CEBS datatables API, backfilling chemical SMILES from a local DSSTox table. CEBS is maintained by the U.S. National Toxicology Program (NTP) at NIEHS.",
